# 🔥 First Middle vs Second Middle

## Second Middle (LeetCode 876)

```cpp
slow = head;
fast = head;
```

Example:

```text
1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6
```

Answer:

```text
4
```

---

## First Middle

Agar first middle return karna ho:

```cpp
slow = head;
fast = head->next;
```

Same example:

```text
1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6
```

Answer:

```text
3
```

---

## Memory Trick

```text
fast = head
        ↓
Second Middle
```

```text
fast = head->next
        ↓
First Middle
```

---

# 💻 C++ Code

```cpp
class Solution {
public:

    ListNode* middleNode(ListNode* head) {

        ListNode* slow = head;
        ListNode* fast = head;

        while(fast != NULL && fast->next != NULL){

            slow = slow->next;

            fast = fast->next->next;
        }

        return slow;
    }
};
```

---

