# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

## 1. Wrong While Condition

Wrong:

```cpp
while(fast != NULL)
```

Correct:

```cpp
while(fast != NULL && fast->next != NULL)
```

---

## 2. Fast ko 1 step move karna

Wrong:

```cpp
fast = fast->next;
```

Correct:

```cpp
fast = fast->next->next;
```

---

## 3. Slow ko 2 steps move karna

Wrong:

```cpp
slow = slow->next->next;
```

Correct:

```cpp
slow = slow->next;
```

---

## 4. First aur Second Middle confuse karna

Second Middle:

```cpp
fast = head;
```

First Middle:

```cpp
fast = head->next;
```

