# 🎯 One-Line Revision

> Slow pointer har iteration me 1 step aur Fast pointer 2 steps move karta hai. Jab Fast list ke end tak pahunchta hai, Slow middle node par hota hai.

## Pattern

```text
Slow & Fast Pointer

↓

1 Step + 2 Steps

↓

Fast Ends

↓

Slow Middle
```
